Z||000000||BBBAD GT||02-09-2000||06:01 PM||||<BR>Are all the ones out on the market just shortened stock units?  I've seen a couple ads for them, and it appears none of them improve the shifting.  I know its a cable shifter, but do any of them improve the actual linkage as to shorten the throws?  Any opinions/experiences out there?  Any recommendations?  <P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||otis||02-09-2000||06:20 PM||||Hey Mr. Bad, I  don't think the short<BR>shifter will do much. But a good tuneup<BR>of cables ie lube, or replace should be<BR>of more value. Chris  West of West Coast<BR>Fiero's even goes  so far as to retro-fit<BR>aftermarket shifters such as B&M. I think they  would be better for two reasons:1.)Better design 2.)Cheaper and readily  available replacement cables.  If  you must have a shortened  shifter , cut the the curve<BR>out and reweld the upper  shaft to the <BR>lower tab and reinstall. Save yourself <BR>the dough and buy a good CD.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Phantom Rage||02-09-2000||06:38 PM||||Just get one from an 84 they are shorter, and won't make it to hard to shift.  A good short shifter should however not just shorten the stick, but increase the length on the other end of the pivot point too.<p>[This message has been edited by Phantom Rage (edited 02-09-2000).]||||reg||7
Z||000003||Monkeyman||02-09-2000||08:29 PM||||Toms got one that not only shortens the stick but the throw as well.  <A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroproject.com</A>  then click on "Site Links" then "Toms Fiero Accessories".||||reg||1
Z||000004||Gokart||02-09-2000||09:05 PM||||I got Tom's! It's awesome!||||reg||14
Z||000005||fierodave||02-09-2000||10:22 PM||||I have Tom's shifter in my 86 GT  If my other 3 fiero's had manuals they would have them,  all my Fieros'that I have had in the last 10 months have had them.  15+<BR>It gives you a better feel for the shift points.....personal opinion? yes!  <BR>but if it is just an impression that's all that matters right?  btw  if the handle is shorter  the throw will be too!  ||||reg||10
